    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=563645721060836147&sectionId=563645721162613555)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gDXpeJySIegHq_text","label":"gDXpeJySIegHq_text","default":"<p>Still Not Sure?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gumjwRkQTLmeE_text","label":"gumjwRkQTLmeE_text","default":"Here Are The Top Questions We Get About <span style=\"color:#D76C95;\">FloralFresh</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_0","label":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_0","default":"<p>Product</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_1","label":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_1","default":"<p>Shipping</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_2","label":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_2","default":"<p>Others</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_3","label":"gg5r5suHM2c_childItem_3","default":"<p>Reference</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_0","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_0","default":"<p>What are vaginal prebiotics + probiotics?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_1","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_1","default":"<p>How does FloraFresh work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_2","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_2","default":"<p>What is a synbiotic?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_3","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_3","default":"<p>Can I take FloraFresh with other supplements?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_4","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_4","default":"<p>Who should take FloraFresh?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_5","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_5","default":"<p>How do I take FloraFresh?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_6","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_6","default":"<p>Can FloraFresh be taken with prescription medications?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_7","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_7","default":"<p>Are there any side effects I should be concerned about with FloraFresh?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_8","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_8","default":"<p>How long does it take for FloraFresh to work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_9","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_9","default":"<p>Can vaginal probiotics affect my menstrual cycle?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_10","label":"ggMAwlGrXGm_childItem_10","default":"<p>What are the key ingredients in FloraFresh?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghzAEIneIS_text","label":"gghzAEIneIS_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh is a carefully formulated vaginal prebiotic + probiotic supplement designed to support a balanced vaginal microbiome. It contains a synergistic blend of probiotics and prebiotics to maintain optimal vaginal pH, promote healthy flora, and help manage unwanted dryness and odors naturally.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggchKAmY9Py_text","label":"ggchKAmY9Py_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh works by replenishing beneficial bacteria in the vaginal ecosystem, helping to crowd out non-beneficial microbes and support a healthy balance. The probiotic strains in FloraFresh—<strong>Lactobacillus salivarius, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, Lactobacillus reuteri, and Lactobacillus gasseri</strong>—have been selected for their ability to promote vaginal health, while <strong>Xylooligosaccharides (Prebiotic XOS) and D-Mannose</strong> provide additional support.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAf5i_TgPF_text","label":"ggAf5i_TgPF_text","default":"<p>A synbiotic combines both <strong>probiotics (beneficial bacteria)</strong> and <strong>prebiotics (nutrients that help probiotics thrive)</strong> to maximize their effectiveness. FloraFresh’s <strong>probiotic blend (15 Billion CFUs)</strong> works in harmony with XOS prebiotics to create a supportive environment for vaginal wellness.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIXTmsXZA_text","label":"ggaIXTmsXZA_text","default":"<p>Yes! FloraFresh is designed to complement other wellness supplements. It pairs well with urinary tract support formulas, PMS relief supplements, and general gut health probiotics. However, if you are taking multiple probiotic formulas, consider spacing them throughout the day for best results.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3O1d12p5q_text","label":"gg3O1d12p5q_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh is ideal for <strong>women ages 20 and up</strong> who want to maintain a <strong>healthy vaginal microbiome</strong>. It’s especially beneficial for those prone to <strong>imbalance, odor concerns, or discomfort due to pH shifts</strong>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggi2qbtFyBl_text","label":"ggi2qbtFyBl_text","default":"<p>Take <strong>2 capsules per day</strong>, preferably with food, or as directed by your healthcare provider. For best results, make FloraFresh part of your <strong>daily wellness routine</strong>.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUZFDBANHF_text","label":"ggUZFDBANHF_text","default":"<p>If you are taking prescription medications or have a medical condition, it's best to <strong>consult your healthcare provider</strong> before starting any new supplement. Do not use if the safety seal is broken or missing.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg61CD1i7Kc_text","label":"gg61CD1i7Kc_text","default":"<p>Warning: Don’t bother hauling extra menstrual pads to work! FloraFresh might hit you with a hydration wave so wild you’ll think you’re Niagara Falls down there—but relax, it’s just our probiotics and Vitamin C turning your dusty, stinky woes into a hot, fresh splash party!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWKzj3mZYo_text","label":"ggWKzj3mZYo_text","default":"<p>Many users notice improvements within 7-14 days, with full benefits after 8 weeks of consistent use. Individual results may vary, but we're confident you'll see positive changes</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjapvgxD2E_text","label":"ggjapvgxD2E_text","default":"<p>Probiotics do not directly alter menstrual cycles, but lifestyle factors, stress, and diet can contribute to cycle changes. If you experience any unusual shifts, consult your healthcare provider.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOoj1p_I0j_text","label":"ggOoj1p_I0j_text","default":"<p>Each serving (2 capsules) contains:</p><ul><li><strong>Vitamin C (as Ascorbic Acid) – 40mg</strong> (44% DV)</li><li><strong>FloraFresh Probiotic Blend – 54mg</strong> (15 Billion CFUs of Lactobacillus strains)</li><li><strong>Xylooligosaccharides (Prebiotic XOS) – 50mg</strong></li><li><strong>D-Mannose – 50mg</strong></li><li><strong>(Capsules are free from artificial additives, gluten, dairy, and GMOs.)</strong></li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_0","label":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is my credit card information secure?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_1","label":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_1","default":"<p>Where do you ship?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_2","label":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_2","default":"<p>How much does shipping cost?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_3","label":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_3","default":"<p>How do I track my package?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_4","label":"ggYCBVBXnrj_childItem_4","default":"<p>I didn’t receive a shipping or order confirmation. Help!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8VFpLp-___text","label":"gg8VFpLp-___text","default":"<p>Yes, all credit card transactions are securely processed through Shopify, PayPal, or Amazon.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXNgRoGZ7a_text","label":"ggXNgRoGZ7a_text","default":"<p>We offer shipping worldwide!<br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxwe77QI9n_text","label":"ggxwe77QI9n_text","default":"<p>Shipping is free for bundle of 60 days and 120 days!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZniogzhxv_text","label":"ggZniogzhxv_text","default":"<p>Want to know if your vitamins are on their way? Tracking information should have been sent to you via email when you placed your order. If you didn’t receive it, send us an email at support@wellnessnest.co.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR5-TNGLAP_text","label":"ggR5-TNGLAP_text","default":"<p>No worries! Email us at support@wellnessnest.co, and we’ll sort it out for you.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_0","label":"ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_0","default":"<p>Are Wellness Nest supplements FDA-approved?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_1","label":"ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_1","default":"<p>Are there any artificial flavors, colors, or dyes in Wellness Nest supplements?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_2","label":"ggih2t7nP_S_childItem_2","default":"<p>Where are Wellness Nest supplements manufactured?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghcyelJxPO_text","label":"gghcyelJxPO_text","default":"<p>By law, the FDA does not approve dietary supplements. However, it does regulate both dietary supplements and their ingredients. At Wellness Nest, we comply with the FDA’s “Current Good Manufacturing Practice” (cGMP) regulations, established in 2007. These require manufacturers to evaluate products for identity, purity, strength, and composition. We go further by testing for stability with our manufacturers and conducting third-party testing for potency of active ingredients, as well as screening for adulterants like heavy metals and microbes, allergens, rancidity, and other unwanted contaminants.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1LLfWGFbH_text","label":"gg1LLfWGFbH_text","default":"<p>Nope! Our vitamins are all-natural, made with vegan, non-GMO, and gluten-free ingredients.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsXWr7i8ur_text","label":"ggsXWr7i8ur_text","default":"<p>Wellness Nest supplements are formulated, manufactured, and packaged with care right here in the USA. That said, some of our products may occasionally be backstocked from third-party manufacturers partnering with our main supplier, based in India, China, or Vietnam.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggujEU4nA-I_text","label":"ggujEU4nA-I_text","default":"<p><strong>1. Johns Hopkins Medicine</strong>: https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/health/wellness-and-prevention/turmeric-benefits</p><p><strong>2. Idyl</strong>: https://www.idyl.co.in/blogs/blog/unlock-the-heart-healthy-secrets-of-curry-leaves</p><p><strong>3. Journal of Midwifery &amp; Women's Health</strong>: https://journals.lww.com/jomh/fulltext/2024/15010/exploring_the_efficacy_and_safety_of_black_cohosh.3.aspx</p><p><strong>4. PMC</strong>: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9881416/</p><p><strong>5. PubMed</strong>: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16552838/</p><p><strong>6. Medical News Today</strong>: https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/317530</p><p><strong>7. Harvard Health Publishing</strong>: https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/turmeric-benefits-a-look-at-the-evidence</p><p><strong>8. NDTV</strong>: https://www.ndtv.com/food/diabetes-how-curry-leaves-kadi-patta-help-manage-blood-sugar-levels-1949847</p><p><strong>9. NIH</strong>: https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/BlackCohosh-HealthProfessional/</p><p><strong>10. WebMD</strong>: https://www.webmd.com/vitamins/ai/ingredientmono-662/turmeric</p><p><strong>11. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/curry-leaves-benefits</p><p><strong>12. Mount Sinai</strong>: https://www.mountsinai.org/health-library/herb/black-cohosh</p><p><strong>13. Mayo Clinic</strong>: https://newsnetwork.mayoclinic.org/discussion/mayo-clinic-minute-are-there-health-benefits-to-taking-turmeric/</p><p><strong>14. Healthline</strong>: https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/top-10-evidence-based-health-benefits-of-turmeric</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"geznomfYacPon_text","label":"geznomfYacPon_text","default":"<p><strong>Still have questions?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggINUbt-0mq_text","label":"ggINUbt-0mq_text","default":"<p>Contact our support team at</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmq_rxa5Z0_text","label":"ggmq_rxa5Z0_text","default":"<p>support@wellnessnest.co</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvnZqhBKwk_text","label":"ggvnZqhBKwk_text","default":"<p>or check out our <strong>Help Center</strong> for more details&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEiHFSjSkO_label","label":"ggEiHFSjSkO_label","default":"<p>Try FloralFresh Now!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3In78yG5O_text","label":"gg3In78yG5O_text","default":"<p><i>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</i></p>"}],
